**Approved Requirement → Performance Scenario → JMeter Test Plan → Execution → Result → Conclusion**

Do not create an unrelated synthetic workload merely to obtain measurable numbers.

If the frozen CP08 specification allows a bounded representative scenario, document exactly what was selected and why.

