# 9. Pass/Fail Determination

Performance PASS/FAIL must be determined against the **frozen CP08 acceptance criteria**.

Do NOT:

* change thresholds;
* remove slow samples;
* exclude failures without justification;
* alter workload after seeing results;
* selectively report only successful requests;
* change the requirement because the environment performs poorly.

If the result fails:

report the failure honestly and classify it.

A failed performance result does NOT automatically mean CP08 failed governance.

Determine the actual CP08 gate according to its specification.

