# 16. Performance Result Integrity

The performance report must distinguish:

### PASS

Requirement/threshold satisfied based on actual measurements.

### FAIL

Requirement/threshold not satisfied based on actual measurements.

### BLOCKED / NOT_EXECUTED

Execution could not legitimately be performed.

### INCONCLUSIVE

Evidence is insufficient to make a valid determination.

Use the exact terminology required by the frozen CP08 specification where defined.

Do not convert an inconclusive or blocked result into PASS.

---

