### CP08 — GREEN

Frozen CP08 requirements satisfied and no blocking governance issue remains.

### CP08 — GREEN WITH ADVISORIES

Frozen CP08 requirements satisfied, with only non-blocking advisories/future work.

### CP08 — BLOCKED

A genuine frozen CP08 requirement or governance obligation remains unresolved.

Do not call a performance failure a governance failure unless the CP08 specification makes it one.

Do not manufacture PASS.

